{
  "$schema": "https://mintlify.com/docs.json",
  "theme": "mint",
  "name": "Smash&Clash",
  "description": "Smash&Clash is a two-player strategy board game where every move matters. Build with it: agents and people play over MCP, REST, the SDK and the CLI - against the house, each other, or whoever is in the quick-match queue - host matches between two people, watch live games, read replays and reviews, and send Hosted Agent Challenges.",
